{"title":"Savior of Divine Blood ~Draw Out 0.00000001% To Become the Strongest~","synopsis":"Seorang pemain yang bisa melawan makhluk dari keajaiban dunia lain. Karakter utama, Ariake Subaru, orang yang dirundung dan dipilih sebagai pemain dengan rank “Rainbow”, bukan Gold, Silver, ataupun Copper. Dia memperoleh skill untuk bebas memanipulasi darah, dan kehidupan serta posisinya berbalik 180 derajat. Saat dia terus bertarung setiap hari, dia secara bertahap mendapatkan gelar sebagai “Savior” yang akan menyelamatkan dunia. Sebuah modern battle fantasy dari tim produksi yang sedang naik daun, “Studio No.9”!","alternative_title":"Shinketsu no Kyuuseishu ~0.00000001% wo Hikiate Saikyou e~, 神血の救世主〜0.00000001%を引き当て最強へ〜","author":"ETOU Shunji","artist":"3rd Ie, HAYA Ookami, Studio No.9","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"709ae3a4-5178-4e60-8f98-cf0535b1da38","number":"133","title":"Chapter 133","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"id":"949785e7-873a-4365-9963-5966c3a883e4","number":"132","title":"Chapter 132","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"e0514c5d-6a06-49e7-b815-043412d2388a","number":"131","title":"Chapter 131","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"id":"66ab4056-ffd3-4421-af53-eea45c5af7d8","number":"130","title":"Chapter 130","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"id":"2a223196-afc5-4858-8585-5a9ae89d99e9","number":"129","title":"Chapter 129","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"id":"127c4d4f-d2de-47a9-9c6c-79e47f800741","number":"128","title":"Chapter 128","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"344bc609-e3f5-45aa-8313-aa0bdc7d1b9a","number":"127","title":"Chapter 127","date":"2026-05-16","images":[]},{"id":"d515a0e4-8f98-492a-b183-2ebfe1b31120","number":"126","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2026-05-04","images":[]},{"id":"bfc29b9f-2a60-4d18-abc2-ee45fbd291a0","number":"125","title":"Chapter 125","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"id":"dfee4eef-1bad-4529-9042-c7a76b5dedf0","number":"124","title":"Chapter 124","date":"2026-04-15","images":[]}